flowchart LR
    Start["start() or run()"] --> Stream["Owned execution<br/>with bounded output"]
    Stream -->|completion or failure| Cleanup["Verify termination<br/>and release"]
    Cleanup -->|verified| Outcome["Result or<br/>execution error"]
    Stream -.->|timeout, cancel, stop| Cleanup
    Cleanup -.->|not verified| Failure["TerminationVerificationError"]
